  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"K\u0131l\u0131\xE7 \xDC\xE7l\xFCs\xFC\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    \"ters\" se\xE7tin.\n\nManevi anlamda ki\u015Finin deh\u015Fetli bir \u015Fekilde
    sars\u0131lmas\u0131n\u0131 konu alan bu kart\u0131 ters \xE7ekerek, ge\xE7mi\u015Finden
    bug\xFCne g\xFCzel haberler getirmi\u015F oldun {{isim}}. Derin bir kalp a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131
    ya\u015Fam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Baz\u0131 insanlar seni ziyadesiyle \xFCzm\xFC\u015F.
    Halini g\xF6ren sevdiklerin de bu durumdan k\xF6t\xFC etkilenmi\u015F. Birilerinin
    yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131 tercihler nedeniyle kendi kendimizi mutsuz etmememiz gerekti\u011Fini
    \xE7ok sonralar anlam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Kendine etti\u011Fin zul\xFCm son
    bulmu\u015F. \xDCzerindeki f\u0131rt\u0131na dinmi\u015F ve tedbiren \u015Femsiyeni
    sonraki ya\u011Fmurlar i\xE7in sonuna kadar a\xE7m\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Tats\u0131z
    an\u0131lar\u0131n kalbinin \xFCzerinde yaratt\u0131\u011F\u0131 ka\u011F\u0131t
    kesikleri, g\xFCnbeg\xFCn iyile\u015Fmeye ba\u015Flam\u0131\u015F."
